  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb6983f289b4a7fde98c9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日…ね。貴方が、\r\n大切に思わせてくださるの？\r\n忘れられないお祝いで…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91bf7066b25cb8b31f049e164167a1025a64c9019e2236c841b9b25e3674526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8b5e4cdd43c2ab85287cca0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせ…ですって。\r\nご覧になったら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5c5a46a9b4f162aac3b90f0d472998c8512f81c76ae400234b6a7e97b74c06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:866619199403d1182df75359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方にプレゼントがあるそうよ。\r\nよかったですわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bf59214e51269c6d4c498b556bf52faaf92197e06eefdf4f0ce9f1121e6216d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0dd70f7c91dd8a881f82c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッションを達成したのね。\r\nそう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed3cb09a5440e61c9a5c5387e25c30e494f8ed8283cd23caff7ac6379dfe1520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade2328c20c7439be8e4483a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが始まるらしいわ。\r\n確認なさらないの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "603cdea5b0589c8bb4e045025ecf80759815b6e116285d7695a96b675904b03c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8373c3ebc14f0fba45c087a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントね…。\r\nどうぞ、お好きに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ca9a9f40bf75bb4a3ad7bbb8d916730aea7a1ac4965dfd54df5a7ee362c34a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96f581eb0345276d94de159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "負けるなんて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edb6a59f3b85e8714c51f3e3cd758d132d0440c15017fed9680790ce241052a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d69891311de8631c010d5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが、\r\n上がったそうよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18950df05c9d06a7cb525e71c18376b009adbd2848de42a7b4e85d0798ef37ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ca1364fa2da67f43688519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引き分け…ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "596698458fd1bce015bb1db5b352b2f9c1ce8e4244af68b659cbfb4f9933dff5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d12361ffe8118685c967964a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然の結果ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "402268b883ad8f86a126e2312b09799dbeac985e2b3e06b04cd748dc079ab326",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e35b596457a2d4e3e29bc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "負けるなんて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edb6a59f3b85e8714c51f3e3cd758d132d0440c15017fed9680790ce241052a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96912953b3d2cc64350af6ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引き分け…ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "596698458fd1bce015bb1db5b352b2f9c1ce8e4244af68b659cbfb4f9933dff5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68c4388aa77e5be7f9b2674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふ、完璧…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ecf7cff77f43fed1aa852949034fa4dc1be0c75af5dfdf3a275de5458c02ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:926c62cd71154e90389a7fcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "望むのは…勝利だけよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6749b6aaaa9093d29055a563dee8469530046cb8d1f9fcf9cca0902e8b2ae48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31836b24d3409b9760ea58f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d97412bcb0659eb26981ac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ…\r\n今日はどうなさるのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1593fbb6a3fc1175bd09eebe0bd8838300a65b055fd19516dfee49bc7bedf0b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8bfacbf942cc804a894fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歴史を学ぶことも、\r\n自分を磨くことに繋がるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e399b885c529f2cf6d3b5199969a704ab208372998ca1d1dcffa2b5380634c49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81f726c039a39e8bab165dbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつでもよろしくてよ。\r\n素晴らしいレースへ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cb60aa77a3f84ffc4735ad368117865b0bbc40866ecc571f2f935b2e31af386",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17374b47fea8deec618b13eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よろしくて？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f07f59fa597e807856cb6bfa4a8af64354b2cde7884b9203a277eff8b813178d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ad93f597803cf1ef0b5fc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アルダン。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e9a469f38096e02627783337deeee8e5c150265fafe7dfe9afcf4da795029a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c35669b760693d3933a8b4e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bff65604b5e856772ac3744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "満たされる…この感じは…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4987d978e064ddbd4e41ae4ca64b5ba790ad547aaa65201d42921c1b2e04ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e30b7a1bd2769476e75fd247",
